'''Elemental Fury''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|dragon shout]] that increases the speed of weapon swings and damage for a short time. It does not work on enchanted or bound weapons. It also does not affect bows, enchanted or otherwise. It has no effects on unarmed combat.

{{NewLeft}}
==Possible Uses==
* Eliminating the speed penalty for slow-swinging weapons.
* Making dual-wielded strikes incredibly fast.
* Using it with a pickaxe to manually [[Skyrim:Mining|mine]] ores quickly. This includes [[Skyrim:Shellbug|Shellbugs]] in the [[Skyrim:Forgotten Vale|Forgotten Vale]] and [[Skyrim:Heart Stone Deposit|Heart Stone Deposits]] on [[Skyrim:Solstheim|Solstheim]]; the latter also includes [[Skyrim:Stalhrim|Stalhrim]] if you have an Ancient Nordic Pickaxe.
* Faster weapon skill training against unkillable targets.
* While dual wielding, you can still enchant the right hand weapon, since it is the left hand that governs the speed of double attacks and double power attacks.
